# NASHVILLE Brand (Updated)

Master brand: **NASHVILLE**. Promise: *The most useful way to plan, book, and experience Nashville.* Feel like a trusted city institution + modern editorial + booking marketplace — not tourism board, blog, affiliate directory, AI startup, or country cliché.

## Identity

- Masthead: uppercase **NASHVILLE** with **one coral star** centered above. No permanent tagline under the logo.
- Campaign lockup only: “Your Guide. Your Nashville.” (counsel clearance pending — never inseparable from logo).
- **NSH** + one star: merchandise / compact only. Three stars: secondary Tennessee detail only — never above the main wordmark.
- Contextual lines OK: Trusted recommendations… · Plan better. Book smarter… · Make the most of Nashville.

## Color (light first)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Navy | `#102A43` | Logo, nav, headings, secondary buttons |
| Cumberland | `#214A72` | Deep section backgrounds |
| Clay Coral | `#D95D45` | Primary CTAs (Plan Your Trip, Check Availability) |
| Dogwood | `#F2B7AE` | Soft accent fields |
| Sky Wash | `#DDECEF` | Light editorial panels |
| Park Mint | `#8FC4AD` | Verified / positive / selective CTAs |
| Golden Hour | `#E8B64A` | Warm highlight (sparingly) |
| Porch Cream | `#F8F3E9` | Page background |
| Soft White | `#FFFDFC` | Cards |
| Charcoal | `#232323` | Body copy |

Buttons: primary = coral/white · secondary = navy/white · tertiary = cream + navy border · positive = mint + navy text. No per-category rainbow.

## Type

- Masthead: **image assets** in `/public/brand/` — never recreate with web fonts or SVG stand-ins
  - `wordmark.png` — header / footer
  - `lockup-stacked.png` / `lockup-horizontal.png` — campaign / hero / promo
  - `nsh.png` — shop / compact chrome
  - `star.png` — favicon / accent
- Display: **Playfair Display** — H1 Bold, H2 Semibold, hero, editorial
- UI: **Inter** — H3 Bold, nav, buttons (Semibold), forms, cards, body (Regular), metadata (Medium)
- Do not introduce Barlow, Oswald, or other logo-substitute fonts

## Homepage

Header light (cream/white), navy text, coral Plan a Trip. Hero bright/approachable — avoid heavy dark overlays. H1: **Make the most of Nashville.** Supporting: trusted recommendations… CTAs: Plan Your Trip · Explore Nashville. Rotate section grounds: cream, white, sky, dogwood, cumberland, mint accents.

## Voice / trust

Direct, honest, useful. Avoid: hidden gem, iconic, vibrant, must-visit, unforgettable, ultimate, Music City magic, AI-powered. Label Sponsored / Paid partnership / Affiliate link / Featured partner. Footer affiliation + affiliate disclosures required.

## Cursor constraints

Do not invent new fonts, colors, logos, star arrangements, taglines, button colors, or icon families without documenting why the system is insufficient.
